  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is attached to a string and moves in a vertical circle of constant radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. At the top of the circle, the tension in the string is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>. Air resistance is negligible.</p>\n<p>What is the kinetic energy of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> at the top of the circle?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{RT-mg}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{RT+mg}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"RT-mg\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"RT+mg\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
